1.0 prints as 1.0
0.1 + 0.2 prints as 0.30000000000000004
1 / 3.0 prints as 0.3333333333333333
1.0e21 prints as 1.0E21
12345678.0 prints as 1.2345678E7
10000000.0 prints as 1.0E7
1000000.0 prints as 1000000.0
0.001 prints as 0.001
0.0001 prints as 1.0E-4
1.0e-10 prints as 1.0E-10
-1 * 0.0 prints as -0.0
-0.5 prints as -0.5
1.0 / 0.0 prints as Infinity
-1.0 / 0.0 prints as -Infinity
0.0 / 0.0 prints as NaN
number 5 joined to text prints as 5.0
integer 5 stored in a number prints as 5.0
output of 2.5 on its own line follows
2.5
